              <Name>Text1</Name>
              <Page isRef="36" />
              <Parent isRef="38" />
              <Text>ATTESTATION DE RÉCEPTION CHEQUE N° {StlSettlementLine.Folder.Code}</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text1>
            <Text2 Ref="40" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>White</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0,3.2,19,0.6</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Expressions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Times New Roman,14,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>d90e7e93b0f0459a864cf9ef7992e872</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Center</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text2</Name>
              <Page isRef="36" />
              <Parent isRef="38" />
              <Text>RECU_{StlSettlementView.ReceiptCode}</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text2>
            <Text3 Ref="41" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>White</Brush>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <CanShrink>True</CanShrink>
              <ClientRectangle>1.4,4.8,16.6,1</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="1">
                <value>StlSettlementView.IsCredit,EqualTo,false,,Boolean,Black,Transparent,Century_x0020_Gothic_x002C_11.25,False,False,,,None</value>
              </Conditions>
              <Expressions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Century Gothic,11</Font>
              <GrowToHeight>True</GrowToHeight>
              <Guid>3268d0b975334f43a6c6382757d623eb</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text3</Name>
              <Page isRef="36" />
              <Parent isRef="38" />
              <Text>Nous soussignés socièté {StlSettlementView.CfgCompanyDescription} {StlSettlementView.CfgComPanyViewLegalForm} dont le siège social est à {StlSettlementView.CfgComPanyViewAddress}, reconnaissons avoir reçu de {StlSettlementLine.CfgCustomerTierTitle} {StlSettlementLine.CfgCustomerDescription} , {StlSettlementLine.CfgCustomerIdentityDocumentType} N° {StlSettlementLine.CfgCustomerIDNumber}{IIF(string.IsNullOrEmpty(ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.Description),""," et de " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.Title + " " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.Description + ", " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.IdentityDocumentType + " N° " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.IDNumber)}{IIF(string.IsNullOrEmpty(ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.Description),""," et de " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.Title + " " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.Description + ", " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.IdentityDocumentType + " N° " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.IDNumber)}, la somme de {Format("{0:C}", StlSettlementLine.Amount)} ({DecimalToLiteral(StlSettlementLine.Amount,CurrencyLabel.CodeValue,CurrencyFraction.CodeValue)}) par {StlSettlementView.Description} représentant un versement sur l'acquisition de :</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
            </Text3>
            <Text4 Ref="42" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>White</Brush>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <CanShrink>True</CanShrink>
              <ClientRectangle>1.4,4.8,16.8,1</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="1">
                <value>StlSettlementView.IsCredit,EqualTo,true,,Boolean,Black,Transparent,Century_x0020_Gothic_x002C_11.25,False,False,,,None</value>
              </Conditions>
              <Expressions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Century Gothic,11</Font>
              <GrowToHeight>True</GrowToHeight>
              <Guid>10e63c23e4a64975b8d9b2d170eef493</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text4</Name>
              <Page isRef="36" />
              <Parent isRef="38" />
              <Text>Nous soussignés {StlSettlementView.Title} {StlSettlementView.CfgTierDescription} , {StlSettlementView.IdentityDocumentType} N° {StlSettlementView.IDNumber}{IIF(string.IsNullOrEmpty(ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.Description),""," et " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.Title + " " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.Description + ", " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.IdentityDocumentType + " N° " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer1.IDNumber)}{IIF(string.IsNullOrEmpty(ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.Description),""," et " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.Title + " " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.Description + ", " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.IdentityDocumentType + " N° " + ComSettlementFolder.Folder.Customer2.IDNumber)}, reconnaissons avoir reçu de la socièté {StlSettlementView.CfgCompanyDescription} {StlSettlementView.CfgComPanyViewLegalForm} dont le siège social est à {StlSettlementView.CfgComPanyViewAddress}, la somme de {Format("{0:C}", StlSettlementLine.Amount)} ({DecimalToLiteral(StlSettlementLine.Amount,CurrencyLabel.CodeValue,CurrencyFraction.CodeValue)}) par {StlSettlementView.Description} représentant un rembourssement sur l'acquisition de :</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>,,,,WordWrap=True,A=0</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
            </Text4>
          </Components>
